{"product_id":"love-my-rifle-more-than-you","title":"Love My Rifle More Than You","description":"\u003cp\u003eFrom basic training to being deployed in Iraq, this is the memoir of a woman's life in the US army. Touching on the major news stories, such as the Abu Ghraib prison, and more universal issues of patriotism, courage and military incompetence, Kayla Williams takes the reader behind the front lines.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 131 x 197\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Kayla Williams\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780753821060\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 256\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45174722986137,"sku":"5RG9780753821060","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67bc35a145b94_Love_20My_20Rifle_20More_20Than_20You_20Kayla_20Williams.jpg?v=1740495377","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/love-my-rifle-more-than-you","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}